# Scratch harnesses left at the root — the browser test runner from when there
# was no Node here (F40), and anything like it since. Root-anchored so it cannot
# swallow a real file in a subdirectory. F38's closing note is the reason this
# is here: a `git add -A` sweeping up whatever happens to be lying about is how
# a repo acquires files nobody meant to ship.
/_*
